; RPT-1 · "reports read zero" — typed accounts that sit BELOW depth 1.
;
; Every account is declared with a `type:` but they all hang off a single
; `Personal:` root that is declared nowhere and means nothing to the English
; name heuristic. A section total summed from `depth == 1` rows reads zero here,
; because the only depth-1 account (`Personal`) has no single effective type.
;
; hledger 1.52 reference (verified, `hledger -f nested-types.journal ...`):
;   bs  Assets $1000.00 / Liabilities $200.00 / Net $800.00
;   is  Revenues $1000.00 / Expenses $200.00 / Net $800.00
;   bal --value=end,'$' type:AL  ->  $800.00

account Personal:Checking  ; type: C
account Personal:Card      ; type: L
account Personal:Salary    ; type: R
account Personal:Food      ; type: X

2026-01-05 Paycheck
    Personal:Checking      $1000.00
    Personal:Salary       $-1000.00

2026-01-10 Groceries
    Personal:Food            $200.00
    Personal:Card           $-200.00
